sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (web or judge)
  participant G as Licence gate
  participant R as Route
  participant K as Core
  participant D as SQLite

  Note over C,D: POST /reports
  C->>G: report JSON
  G->>G: licence valid? (in-memory, vs clock)
  G->>R: pass
  R->>K: validate type, value, pincode, occurred_at
  alt invalid
    K-->>C: 400 {"error"}
  end
  K->>K: normalise identifier
  K->>K: HMAC reporter_id, ip_prefix (or connection /24, /48)
  K->>D: rate counter for reporter HMAC
  alt more than 3 in an hour
    K-->>C: 429
  end
  K->>K: fingerprint note, discard text
  K->>D: insert report
  K->>K: re-cluster identifier, set counted / merged / suspect
  K->>D: update cases row and area_day (counted only)
  R-->>C: 201 {report_id, case_id, merged}

  Note over C,D: GET /lookup?type&value
  C->>G: query
  G->>R: pass
  R->>K: validate and normalise
  alt invalid
    K-->>C: 400 {"error"}
  end
  K->>D: verified list?
  alt verified
    K-->>C: 200 VERIFIED_BUSINESS
  end
  K->>D: cases row by identifier HMAC (one indexed read)
  alt no row
    K-->>C: 200 NO_REPORTS
  end
  K->>K: verdict, challenge cap, mask until 3 distinct reporters
  R-->>C: 200 verdict, counts, display_value, evidence, challenged
